<title>USA: Roseland, N.J., won by Prudential Securities.</title>
<headline>Roseland, N.J., won by Prudential Securities.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities, Inc said it won $3.67 million of Roseland, N.J., general improvement bonds, with a net interest cost of 5.13 percent.</p>
